================================================================================
CHALLENGE 3: THE HIGH-TRAFFIC PRODUCT PAGE (ReadWriteLock)
================================================================================
SCENARIO: An e-commerce site has a "Product Price". 1,000 users are looking
at the price (Reading), and 1 admin is updating the price (Writing).
A 'ReentrantLock' would block the 1,000 users. A 'ReadWriteLock' allows
them all to read simultaneously!

1. Create 'ProductPage' class with 'private double price = 99.99;'.
2. Use 'private final ReentrantReadWriteLock rwLock = new ReentrantReadWriteLock();'.
3. Create 'getPrice()':
   - Acquire 'rwLock.readLock().lock()'.
   - Print "Reading price..." and return price.
   - Unlock in finally.
4. Create 'setPrice(double newPrice)':
   - Acquire 'rwLock.writeLock().lock()'.
   - Print "Updating price..." and update the field.
   - Unlock in finally.
5. CHALLENGE: Start 5 reader threads and 1 writer thread. Observe how
   multiple readers can be inside 'getPrice' at the same time.

